      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tennyson%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Tennyson’s public library is a branch of the Boonville‑Warrick County Public Library system, serving residents with books and community programs.",
